  Slug: the-radiant
  DisplayName: The Radiant
  IconPath: icons/environment/people/infantry-army.webp
  Description: Leaders must live bigger lives than any other, shining so brightly
    that they attract followers, inspire troops, and change the course of kingdoms.
    You are trained in Diplomacy. After you Spark Transcendence, you inspire an ally
    within 30 feet to push on, restoring Hit Points equal to @Damage[(2*(1+@actor.level))[healing]|traits:emotion,mental]{2
    + double your level}; this is a mental and emotion effect. The ally is then temporarily
    immune for 10 minutes.
